00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:06.396
We partnered with AWS for two things the infrastructure
to run this reliably for millions of interactions,

00:10:06.796 --> 00:10:11.996
and the team to work alongside ours
to solve problems we never saw before.

00:10:12.956 --> 00:10:16.156
This wasn't here's a product. Figure it out.

00:10:16.636 --> 00:10:21.636
This was, let's build something
together that none of us could build alone.

00:10:22.156 --> 00:10:24.916
And that collaboration made all the difference.

00:10:27.396 --> 00:10:31.916
We envisioned a five level transformation from basic monitoring

00:10:32.156 --> 00:10:39.156
and manual processes to AI powered capabilities
like predictive analytics and self-healing systems.

00:10:40.516 --> 00:10:48.676
This journey is about moving from reactive
to proactive and eventually to fully automated operations.

00:10:49.556 --> 00:10:55.716
Each level builds on the last,
progressing from manual processes to predictive analytics.

00:10:58.156 --> 00:11:01.756
Our first step was creating a unified platform called cockpit.

00:11:02.636 --> 00:11:10.596
This brought data together across 130 plus accounts,
enabling real time insights and proactive monitoring.

00:11:11.436 --> 00:11:17.316
Accessing information is now faster,
reducing search time from hours to just minutes.

00:11:17.996 --> 00:11:23.196
Proactive monitoring ensures
issues are identified before they escalate.

00:11:25.836 --> 00:11:33.116
The impact was immediate. Accessing
information went from five hours to just five minutes.

00:11:33.836 --> 00:11:37.756
A consolidated view replaced the chaos of scattered data.

00:11:38.476 --> 00:11:44.276
Proactive monitoring helped us spot issues early,
avoiding cascading failures.

00:11:47.236 --> 00:11:51.036
Phase two focused on scaling efficiency with Agentic AI.

00:11:51.996 --> 00:11:57.556
We wanted operations that were fast,
accurate, and easy for everyone to use.

00:11:58.396 --> 00:12:06.156
The goal was to transform Multi-account AWS
operations into natural conversations via Slack.

00:12:08.756 --> 00:12:15.356
Before I continue further, I'd like
to show a video to illustrate the change and impact with Agentic AI.

00:12:17.236 --> 00:12:19.196
So Mr. Wong did what good engineers do.

00:12:19.436 --> 00:12:25.076
He went back to the whiteboard.
One platform, one unified view of everything.

00:12:25.076 --> 00:12:28.756
The team built it together for the first time.

00:12:29.036 --> 00:12:32.396
Everyone looking at the same data at the same time.

00:12:33.116 --> 00:12:37.356
Collaboration replaced. Firefighting insights.

00:12:37.396 --> 00:12:39.116
Replaced guesswork.

00:12:41.116 --> 00:12:45.476
Today, the platform runs itself real time.

00:12:45.996 --> 00:12:48.556
Automated. Always on.

00:12:49.076 --> 00:12:49.716
One evening.

00:12:49.956 --> 00:12:52.636
Jagadeesh gets a CVE alert heading home.

00:12:53.156 --> 00:12:56.476
He opens Slack, asks the AI agent one question.

00:12:56.796 --> 00:13:04.076
Within seconds, every vulnerable project,
every account identified before he leaves the station.

00:13:04.076 --> 00:13:08.916
What used to mean a three hour
scramble back to the office now takes seconds.

00:13:09.196 --> 00:13:12.116
Not just a milestone. A transformation.

00:13:16.036 --> 00:13:16.556
And behind.

00:13:16.556 --> 00:13:17.076
It all.

00:13:17.596 --> 00:13:19.596
The team that made it real.

00:13:20.996 --> 00:13:23.556
And this is a team that made it all possible.

00:13:26.916 --> 00:13:33.116
Information access is now 95% faster,
reducing time from minutes to seconds.

00:13:33.716 --> 00:13:38.476
Troubleshooting is streamlined. Cutting resolution time by 60%.

00:13:39.076 --> 00:13:47.516
Centralized access eliminates the need
for multiple logins, improving efficiency. At MoE.

