We believe if we take care of our schools,
our school leaders will take care of our teachers.

00:13:53.596 --> 00:13:57.396
When teachers are well taken care of, they can focus on our students.

00:13:57.996 --> 00:14:02.076
When students are well taken care of,
They will take care of our future.

